    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Mona Lisa, as a skeleton.</strong> A walking portrait whose smile cannot be read. She never speaks; she raises one eyebrow. Creatures that stare too long start wondering whether she is amused, threatened or merely bored, and lose the fight to that question.</p><p><strong>GM notes.</strong> Play her calm. Open with <em>False Appearance</em> on a wall. Use <strong>The Smile</strong> when three or more are bunched. <strong>Soft Focus</strong> makes her hard to snipe, so ranged characters should close in. Vulnerable to acid (paint thinner). 700 XP. Pair with the Blue Boy (450 XP, x1.5 = 1725, a Hard fight).</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "alignment": "neutral",
      "race": null,
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
